    qu "*{i}哭声{/i}*"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:3994
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_623ff31c:

    # qu "And I never will."
    qu "而且我永远都不会。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4002
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_e586faa4:

    # qu "That's why I returned to Buddy when I grew older."
    qu "这就是为什么我长大后又回到了Buddy。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4003
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_c4aff943:

    # qu "I skipped school, snuck away from my house, and would hang out at his place - the place I used to call home."
    qu "我逃学，偷偷溜出家门，就跑去他那儿——那地方我以前叫家。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4005
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_d7ea8274:

    # qu "He made it clear to me that he wasn't letting me stay there with him; he didn't like that I was there to begin with. But I insisted that I wanted to hang around, so he let me."
    qu "他明确告诉我，他不让我继续住在他那里；从一开始他就不太喜欢我待在那里。但我坚持想留下来，所以他只好让我留下。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4006
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_5b82b887:

    # qu "Years later, when I asked him for some weed, he gave me some. He taught me how to use it, how much to use, and what not to do with it."
    qu "多年后，我向他要了些大麻，他给了我。他教我怎么用，用多少，还有哪些事绝对不能做。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4007
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_e6de7d61:

    # qu "By the time I was in high school, I knew more than most guys my age about drugs."
    qu "到高中时，我已经比同龄大多数男生更懂毒品的事了。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4009
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_0327818d:

    # qu "I kept my front up to my new family, but they weren't gullible; they knew I was slipping."
    qu "我假装在新家庭里表现正常，但他们并不傻，他们知道我正在滑坡。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4010
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_975be863:

    # qu "They confronted me about my drug use and even punished me in all the ways they could think of."
    qu "他们直接问我用了什么药，还用尽了所有能想到的方式惩罚我。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4011
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_c58a8ae0:

    # qu "They were desperate for me not to end up like I had started in life."
    qu "他们希望我别像我一开始那样堕落下去。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4013
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_6abf67a9:

    # qu "They told me they were losing their daughter and that they didn't know what to do about it. They begged me to help them help me."
    qu "他们跟我说他们正在失去女儿，说他们不知道该怎么办。他们求我帮忙，帮他们帮我。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4014
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_26aced2e:

    # qu "But I've only been their daughter on paper; it has never felt genuine to me. I've felt like a parasite."
    qu "但我只是名义上的女儿，从未真正感觉过归属。我感觉自己像个寄生虫。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4016
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_c6aac5b8:

    # qu "Like someone who knows they don't belong in their home but stays to survive."
    qu "像知道自己不属于那个家，却为了活命而留下的人。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4017
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_c56de376:

    # qu "Eating their food, sleeping in their bed...plainly using them."
    qu "吃着他们的食物，睡着他们的床……明目张胆地利用他们。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4019
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_a0040a2f:

    # qu "That's how I felt."
    qu "这就是我当时的感觉。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4020
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_c6debbd1:

    # qu "And I kept using them. I fooled them into thinking that I had changed my ways."
    qu "我继续利用他们，骗他们以为我已经改过自新了。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4021
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_836d6dae:

    # qu "I knew what they wanted from me and appearances make a world of difference."
    qu "我知道他们想要什么，外表能差很多。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4023
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_1d23e3c0:

    # qu "As long as I did well in school, they were happy."
    qu "只要我成绩好，他们就满意。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4024
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_c8277574:

    # qu "They didn't have to know I was slinging drugs to classmates after class."
    qu "他们没必要知道我下课后还在给同学卖毒品。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4026
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_299732ee:

    # qu "That's how I got started with all of this. I was born into it. It was my legacy."
    qu "就是这样，我开始了这一切。我生来就身处其中，这是我的家传，我的宿命。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4027
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_dfef7457:

    # qu "And that's how I met Riona..."
    qu "就是这样我认识到了Riona..."

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4029
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_6018db71:

    # qu "She was one of my favorite customers - a goth gullible girl without a father figure."
    qu "她是我的一位最爱客户——一个毫无父亲形象的哥特系傻女孩。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4030
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_d4aaadda:

    # qu "She didn't even realize how much I was ripping her off."
    qu "她甚至没意识到我骗了她多少钱。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4031
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_3aeefa07:

    # qu "I'd charge her extra and pocket the surplus."
    qu "我故意多收她的钱，把差价都揣进兜里。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4033
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_a1cb6307:

    # qu "In time, I almost felt bad for her. This stupid addict couldn't quit smoking and spent all she had on what I could offer."
    qu "渐渐地，我几乎开始同情她了。这个蠢货戒不掉烟，把所有钱都花在我能给的东西上。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4034
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_5e8a03c7:

    # qu "We started talking more and ended up at the same parties."
    qu "我们开始聊得更多，最后竟然去了同一个派对。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4036
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_77f4da7a:

    # qu "Before I knew it, she had become something more than my customer. Somehow, she had managed to weasel her way into my life and become my friend."
    qu "不知不觉，她已不只是我的顾客。她不知怎么就钻进了我的生活，成了我的朋友。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4037
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_41abf8af:

    # qu "And I didn't like that. She had gotten way too close to me. And it had to stop."
    qu "我不喜欢这样。她已经离我太近了。这得结束了。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4039
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_e43f4d19:

    # qu "I told her I had charged her extra for the drugs, just to provoke her."
    qu "我告诉她我多收了她钱，就为了激怒她。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4040
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_8f1f9d6d:

    # qu "I wanted her to hate me. But she barely got annoyed. She even forgave me."
    qu "我想让她恨我。可她连生气都懒得动。她甚至原谅了我。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4042
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_c8ed66dc:

    # qu "And that got me even madder."
    qu "这让我更生气了。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4043
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_76f5288a:

    # qu "I was mad that she was ok with being used, so I figured I might as well keep using her until she had enough."
    qu "我气她竟然能接受被利用，所以干脆继续利用她，直到她受不了为止。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4045
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_f979ad4b:

    # qu "She started selling drugs and doing my work for me. Now that I had her to do the legwork, I barely had to lift a finger."
    qu "她开始卖毒品，还替我做那些脏活累活。现在有她在帮我打理一切，我几乎不用动手。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4046
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_a757223c:

    # qu "She was my marionette. And controlling her became a new normal."
    qu "她是我的提线木偶。控制她，成了我习以为常的事。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4047
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_dfbdf414:

    # qu "I've kept at it for so long that it doesn't even feel weird anymore."
    qu "我干了这么久，现在连感觉都变奇怪了。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4049
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_6c2badea:

    # qu "I didn't even think about what I was doing to her. I never put her best interest first."
    qu "我甚至没想过我在对她做什么。我从没把她最好的利益放在第一位。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4050
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_e1024e22:

    # qu "And at any moment I felt that she was slipping, I'd be sure to correct her..."
    qu "只要我觉得她有点不对劲，我就会立刻把她拉回来。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4051
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_10071848:

    # qu "...either by saying something nice to manipulate her, or with some tough love."
    qu "……要么用些好话来操控她，要么就来点严厉的管教。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4053
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_528a922e:

    # qu "I didn't want the family that was handed to me. So, I treated them like shit."
    qu "我没想要那个被塞给我的家庭。所以我也把他们当狗屎一样对待。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4054
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_bf770543:

    # qu "And I didn't want a friend who wanted to be mine. So, I treated her like shit, too."
    qu "我不想交一个想当我朋友的人当朋友。所以，我也把她当狗一样对待。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4055
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_41cf7056:

    # qu "I haven't done anything to deserve them."
    qu "我没做任何值得他们这样对待我的事。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4059
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_59728ccf:

    # mc "Why are you telling me all this? I mean...why now?"
    mc "你为什么现在才告诉我这些？我是说……为什么现在？"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4063
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_df9c3ee5:

    # qu "Because I don't know if there will be a later."
    qu "因为我也不知道以后会不会有。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4067
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_184d5316:

    # qu "Riona isn't sick."
    qu "Riona没病。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4068
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_9ce1b4da:

    # qu "Vinny snitched on her to Buddy, and Buddy hurt her."
    qu "Vinny把她出卖给了Buddy，Buddy还伤了她。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4069
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_c5730ec1:

    # qu "He ripped her piercings from her face and beat the shit out of her after he found out she's been selling drugs for me."
    qu "他扯掉了她的面部穿孔，然后把她狠狠揍了一顿，因为他发现她一直在替我卖毒品。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4070
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_3706da91:

    # qu "And he squeezed out every bit of information he needed and learned that I've been overcharging his products for personal gain."
    qu "他榨干了他需要的所有信息，还发现我一直为了私利在抬高他的产品价格。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4072
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_8e266a7e:

    # qu "And with how he handled it, there's no return from here."
    qu "而且他处理这件事的方式，已经没有回头路了。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4073
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_6ddae724:

    # qu "I've always thought I had nothing left to lose, but almost losing Riona made me realize that it didn't have to be like this."
    qu "我以前一直以为自己已经一无所有了，但几乎失去Riona让我明白，事情本不必这样。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4074
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_fe566244:

    # qu "At least not for Riona."
    qu "至少不是对你。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4076
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_2c49b0d2:

    # mc "Quinn... What the hell?"
    mc "Quinn...见鬼？"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4078
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_08cae2be:

    # qu "I know. Say that you're angry with me."
    qu "我知道。说你对我很生气。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4079
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_a38630a8:

    # qu "Tell me I'm a parasite and a horrible human being. Just say it."
    qu "告诉我我是个寄生虫，是个可怕的家伙。就这么说出来。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4084
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_88d45fdb:

    # mc "I won't say it. You've done horrible things. No one can deny that. But you've had a tough life."
    mc "我不会说的。你做过可怕的事，没人能否认。但你这一生过得太难了。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4085
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_89e00584:

    # mc "Growing up the way you did made you refuse to see that you are worthy of something more."
    mc "你从小长大的方式让你拒绝承认自己值得拥有更好的东西。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4086
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_da8fe176:

    # mc "You're worthy of your family and friends. You're self-sabotaging, treating them like you did."
    mc "你值得你的家人和朋友。你一直在自我毁灭，对待他们的方式就跟以前一样。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4088
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_c435165e:

    # qu "No! Say that I'm horrible. I am broken beyond repair and you know it."
    qu "不！说我是个恶人，说我已经坏得无可救药。你明明知道。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4090
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_fa339976:

    # mc "If you had only told me about the bad things you did, I would have believed that."
    mc "如果你早告诉我你做过那些坏事，我早就相信了。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4091
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_be9e083b:

    # mc "But I know that there is another side to you. The one I've seen, and the one I see right now."
    mc "但我清楚你还有另一面。那面我曾见过，现在也正看着。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4093
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_163add06:

    # mc "And that's the side that makes me care, spend all this time with you, and sleep with you."
    mc "而这正是让我在意你的地方，花这么多时间陪你，甚至和你睡觉的原因。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4094
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_e6957292:

    # mc "I'm sure that's the side that made Riona want to be your friend. And the side that made your family keep fighting for you, even when you didn't want it."
    mc "我确定就是这面让你想做我朋友的那部分。也是让你的家人一直为你拼命的那部分，即使你根本不想他们这么做。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4100
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_a0ac4865:

    # qu "It's too late, [name]. I'm never gonna change."
    qu "已经太晚了[name]我永远不会改变。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4102
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_ad1cdfb3:

    # mc "As long as you're still breathing, it's not too late to change."
    mc "只要你还活着，改变还来得及。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4103
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_9e43b85c:

    # mc "But what about Rio? How is she doing now?"
    mc "但里奥呢？她现在怎么样了？"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4106
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_b619cb3e:

    # mc "I... I can't defend you. I guessed something serious was happening, but this...?"
    mc "我...我没办法为你辩护。我猜到有些严重的事情发生了，但这样...？"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4108
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_ff2d7094:

    # mc "You haven't had an easy life, but I don't understand how you can choose to use Riona like that... How do you choose to hurt someone wanting to be your friend?"
    mc "你这一生也不容易，但我实在想不通你怎么能这样对待Riona……你到底是怎么下得去手的？怎么伤害一个真心想当你朋友的人？"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4109
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_1359cf6e:

    # mc "Quinn... That's horrible."
    mc "Quinn...这太可怕了。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4111
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_e69e4fb5:

    # qu "I know. I am horrible. You finally see it, too."
    qu "我知道，我很糟糕。你终于也看清了。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4113
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_7c312d10:

    # mc "What about Rio? How is she doing? I thought she was sick, but this changes everything."
    mc "Rio现在怎么样？她还好吗？我本来以为她生病了，但这件事完全改变了我的想法。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4115
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_ab728a7e:

    # qu "I went to see her immediately after it happened. It was a sight I wish to forget, but it's etched into my cornea."
    qu "我立刻就去见了她。那场面我希望能忘掉，但它却刻进了我的角膜里。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4116
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_29c4e33e:

    # qu "She punched me and told me to stay away and never speak to her again."
    qu "她打了我一拳，然后让我离她远点，永远别跟她说话了。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4117
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_afe628cf:

    # qu "It took her this long to say it... And when she finally did..."
    qu "花了她这么久才说出口……结果她终于说了……"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4119
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_33af335c:

    # qu "I didn't want her to say it."
    qu "我不想她亲口说出来。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4120
translate schinese ep11_pp_quinn2_event_label_ad86e88d:

