    mc "什么烦的？"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4210
translate schinese ep11_pp_zoey_endb_label_a187ce99:

    # zo "The brain rot I get from talking to that brown-haired chick."
    zo "每次和那个棕发女孩说话，我都觉得自己脑子要坏掉了。"

# freeroam\episode11\ep11_freeroam_party_events.rpy:4212
translate schinese ep11_pp_zoey_endb_label_c07fca4d:

